  "body": "## Goal\nCorrect the current planning visual topology after user feedback.\n\n## Confirmed correction\nThe Run Command strategic map must show **one Ward Citadel home base** as the shared root, from which the upper, middle, and lower fronts branch outward to separate Veil pressure endpoints. It must not read as three parallel routes with three separate friendly bases.\n\n## Scope\n- Current visual direction contract and all active router projections\n- Planning board v2 and provenance metadata\n- Contract validators/tests for the topology\n- No Godot code, Scene, Resource, or runtime asset replacement\n\n## Acceptance\n- `MAP_TOPOLOGY = ONE_WARD_CITADEL_ROOT__THREE_DIVERGING_FRONT_ROUTES` is present in current owners.\n- v2 board supersedes the parallel-composition v1 board.\n- Current Godot battlefield remains explicitly legacy; no runtime PASS claim.",
